Relevant columns and their potential usage for building the requested 2021‑based report  

• "ORDERS"."order_id": join key to "ORDER_ITEMS"  
• "ORDERS"."user_id": join key to "USERS"  
• "ORDERS"."created_at": filter orders placed in 2021 ( 160 945 920 000 0000 – 164 099 519 900 0000 µs)  
• "USERS"."id": join key to "ORDERS" / "ORDER_ITEMS"  
• "USERS"."created_at": filter users who registered in 2021  
• "USERS"."country": grouping element in final report  
• "ORDER_ITEMS"."order_id": join key to "ORDERS"  
• "ORDER_ITEMS"."product_id": join key to "INVENTORY_ITEMS"/"PRODUCTS"  
• "ORDER_ITEMS"."inventory_item_id": join key to "INVENTORY_ITEMS"  
• "INVENTORY_ITEMS"."id": join key to "ORDER_ITEMS"  
• "INVENTORY_ITEMS"."product_id": join key back to "PRODUCTS"  
• "INVENTORY_ITEMS"."created_at": filter inventory items created in 2021  
• "INVENTORY_ITEMS"."cost": product cost part of profit calculation  
• "INVENTORY_ITEMS"."product_department": grouping element  
• "INVENTORY_ITEMS"."product_category": grouping element  
• "PRODUCTS"."id": join key to "INVENTORY_ITEMS"/"ORDER_ITEMS"  
• "PRODUCTS"."retail_price": product retail price part of profit calculation  

Typical conditions to isolate the 2021 scope  

1. Orders placed in 2021  
   "o"."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000  

2. Users who registered in 2021  
   "u"."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000  

3. Inventory items created in 2021  
   "ii"."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000  

--------------------------------------------------------------------
Below are ten exploratory Snowflake SQL snippets (each limited to 20 rows) that gradually progress from simple inspections to a complete prototype of the requested aggregation.  
All identifiers are enclosed in double quotes and every query ends with LIMIT 20.

```sql
-- 1) Description: Peek at 2021‑era order headers
SELECT 
    "order_id",
    "user_id",
    "created_at",
    "status"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS" o
WHERE "created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Description: Distinct months (as raw µs) in 2021 orders
SELECT DISTINCT 
    "created_at"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS" o
WHERE "created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
ORDER BY "created_at"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Description: Users who signed up in 2021 and their country
SELECT 
    "id"   AS "user_id",
    "country",
    "created_at"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."USERS" u
WHERE "created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Description: Sample inventory items that were created in 2021
SELECT 
    "id"                              AS "inventory_item_id",
    "product_id",
    "product_department",
    "product_category",
    "cost",
    "created_at"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."INVENTORY_ITEMS" ii
WHERE "created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Description: Join orders (2021) with users (2021 sign‑ups)
SELECT 
    o."order_id",
    o."user_id",
    u."country",
    o."created_at" AS "order_created_at",
    u."created_at" AS "user_created_at"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS"  o
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."USERS"   u
     ON o."user_id" = u."id"
WHERE o."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND u."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Description: Order line items tied to inventory items created in 2021
SELECT 
    oi."order_id",
    oi."inventory_item_id",
    ii."product_department",
    ii."product_category",
    ii."cost",
    ii."created_at" AS "inventory_created_at"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"    oi
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."INVENTORY_ITEMS" ii
     ON oi."inventory_item_id" = ii."id"
WHERE ii."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Description: Attach retail prices from PRODUCTS to those 2021 inventory items
SELECT 
    ii."id"                AS "inventory_item_id",
    p."retail_price",
    ii."cost",
    ii."product_department",
    ii."product_category"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."INVENTORY_ITEMS" ii
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"        p
     ON ii."product_id" = p."id"
WHERE ii."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Description: Combine orders, users, order_items, inventory_items, and products in 2021 context
SELECT 
    o."order_id",
    u."country",
    ii."product_department",
    ii."product_category",
    p."retail_price",
    ii."cost",
    o."created_at" AS "order_created_at"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS"          o
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"     oi ON o."order_id" = oi."order_id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."INVENTORY_ITEMS" ii ON oi."inventory_item_id" = ii."id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"        p  ON ii."product_id" = p."id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."USERS"           u  ON o."user_id"  = u."id"
WHERE o."created_at"  BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND u."created_at"  BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND ii."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) Description: Prototype aggregation – monthly profit & counts (raw month extracted by DIV trick)
SELECT 
    FLOOR(o."created_at" / 1000000 / 86400 / 30) AS "approx_month_bucket",
    u."country",
    ii."product_department",
    ii."product_category",
    COUNT(DISTINCT o."order_id")     AS "orders_cnt",
    COUNT(DISTINCT o."user_id")      AS "unique_purchasers",
    SUM(p."retail_price" - ii."cost") AS "profit"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS"          o
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"     oi ON o."order_id" = oi."order_id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."INVENTORY_ITEMS" ii ON oi."inventory_item_id" = ii."id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"        p  ON ii."product_id" = p."id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."USERS"           u  ON o."user_id"  = u."id"
WHERE o."created_at"  BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND u."created_at"  BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND ii."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
GROUP BY 1,2,3,4
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 10) Description: Final‑style report with human‑readable month (uses TO_TIMESTAMP for display only)
SELECT 
    TO_CHAR(TO_TIMESTAMP(o."created_at" / 1000000), 'YYYY‑MM') AS "order_month",
    u."country",
    ii."product_department",
    ii."product_category",
    COUNT(DISTINCT o."order_id")     AS "orders_cnt",
    COUNT(DISTINCT o."user_id")      AS "unique_purchasers",
    SUM(p."retail_price" - ii."cost") AS "profit"
FROM "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDERS"          o
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."ORDER_ITEMS"     oi ON o."order_id" = oi."order_id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."INVENTORY_ITEMS" ii ON oi."inventory_item_id" = ii."id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."PRODUCTS"        p  ON ii."product_id" = p."id"
JOIN "THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."THELOOK_ECOMMERCE"."USERS"           u  ON o."user_id"  = u."id"
WHERE o."created_at"  BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND u."created_at"  BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
  AND ii."created_at" BETWEEN 1609459200000000 AND 1640995199000000
GROUP BY 1,2,3,4
ORDER BY 1,2,3,4
LIMIT 20;
```

These ten queries should give you a thorough, step‑by‑step understanding of the data needed before producing the ultimate 2021 monthly performance report grouped by country, product department, and product category.
